  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34675892",
      "title": "Adding Expenses to the Database (via action())",
      "lectureOrder": 64,
      "videoOrder": 58,
      "sourceHash": "fe2154626b3f11eb3e8b216255f11b7930532c71f29945b33827c81223993f9f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.71,
          "en": "So in this action in the add.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.71,
          "end": 6.25,
          "en": "I will now call addExpense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.92,
          "end": 9.36,
          "en": "and the this function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.36,
          "end": 11.07,
          "en": "of course, must be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.07,
          "end": 16.07,
          "en": "from the data folder and there from expenses.server.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.5,
          "end": 18.36,
          "en": "And that's what I meant now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.36,
          "end": 20.34,
          "en": "Here Remix will always make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.34,
          "end": 22.95,
          "en": "that if it encounters such an import,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.95,
          "end": 25.38,
          "en": "it only includes the imported code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.38,
          "end": 27.3,
          "en": "in the backend code bundle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.3,
          "end": 29.343,
          "en": "not in the front end code bundle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.18,
          "end": 33.6,
          "en": "But with that, we can call addExpense here in the action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.6,
          "end": 35.79,
          "en": "And now we need to pass the form data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.79,
          "end": 38.97,
          "en": "that was submitted to that addExpense function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.97,
          "end": 42.36,
          "en": "because addExpense does expect to get that expenseData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.36,
          "end": 43.383,
          "en": "as an argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.76,
          "end": 47.4,
          "en": "For that, I'll turn my action into an async function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.4,
          "end": 48.36,
          "en": "which you can do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.36,
          "end": 51.93,
          "en": "Your actions and loaders can be async or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.93,
          "end": 54.27,
          "en": "That's up to you. Both are supported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.27,
          "end": 57.69,
          "en": "And we'll also use object destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.69,
          "end": 60.03,
          "en": "to get access to the request property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.03,
          "end": 63.03,
          "en": "that's part of the object that's automatically received",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.03,
          "end": 64.77,
          "en": "on this action here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.77,
          "end": 66.72,
          "en": "because that's also something I covered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.72,
          "end": 68.67,
          "en": "in the Remix Essentials section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 68.67,
          "end": 72.15,
          "en": "Your action and loader functions do get an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.15,
          "end": 74.28,
          "en": "provided by Remix, which is the thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.28,
          "end": 76.62,
          "en": "that calls these functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.62,
          "end": 79.89,
          "en": "And this object, for example, has a request property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.89,
          "end": 82.23,
          "en": "It also has a params property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.23,
          "end": 85.86,
          "en": "and the request property simply stores some information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.86,
          "end": 88.77,
          "en": "about the request that triggered the execution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.77,
          "end": 91.35,
          "en": "of this action function in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.35,
          "end": 93.75,
          "en": "And params would contain any information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 93.75,
          "end": 96.09,
          "en": "about dynamic path segments",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 96.09,
          "end": 97.92,
          "en": "but that's not relevant for this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 97.92,
          "end": 101.343,
          "en": "because this route has no dynamic path segment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.50999999999999,
          "end": 104.31,
          "en": "But the request is needed here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 104.31,
          "end": 106.38,
          "en": "to call the formData method on it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 106.38,
          "end": 109.77000000000001,
          "en": "which is a method that exists on this request object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.77000000000001,
          "end": 112.8,
          "en": "which yields a promise, which ultimately resolves",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 112.8,
          "end": 117.66,
          "en": "to an object that gives us access to the submitted data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 117.66,
          "end": 121.14,
          "en": "So here I'll await this formData method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 121.14,
          "end": 124.113,
          "en": "so that I get my formData object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.04,
          "end": 126.87,
          "en": "And now this formData object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 126.87,
          "end": 131.4,
          "en": "does not have key-value pairs, like formData.title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 131.4,
          "end": 133.8,
          "en": "to get access to the submitted title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.8,
          "end": 136.558,
          "en": "But instead, it has methods like the get method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 136.558,
          "end": 139.29,
          "en": "where we then specify the name of the input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.29,
          "end": 141.333,
          "en": "of which we wanna get the value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 142.29,
          "end": 144.54,
          "en": "Now, if you don't wanna call get multiple times",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 144.54,
          "end": 145.74,
          "en": "for all the inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 145.74,
          "end": 149.57999999999998,
          "en": "you can also simply convert it to a key-value object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 149.57999999999998,
          "end": 152.1,
          "en": "where your input names are the keys",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 152.1,
          "end": 155.57999999999998,
          "en": "and the entered values are the values for those keys.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 155.57999999999998,
          "end": 158.97,
          "en": "By using the built-in object class here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 158.97,
          "end": 161.25,
          "en": "and calling fromEntries on that class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 161.25,
          "end": 164.49,
          "en": "a static method you can call on this class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 164.49,
          "end": 166.35,
          "en": "you can pass formData to it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 166.35,
          "end": 169.196,
          "en": "so that you get the expenseData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 169.196,
          "end": 171,
          "en": "and this now will simply be an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 171,
          "end": 174.63,
          "en": "where you have these simple key-value pairs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 174.63,
          "end": 176.49,
          "en": "And it's this expenseData object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 176.49,
          "end": 179.073,
          "en": "which you can now pass to addExpense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 180.09,
          "end": 182.94,
          "en": "You can, of course, always add a console.log statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 182.94,
          "end": 184.77,
          "en": "to look into that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 184.77,
          "end": 186.12,
          "en": "to see what's inside of there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 186.12,
          "end": 188.34,
          "en": "if you're not sure you're getting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 188.34,
          "end": 190.89,
          "en": "You can also log the formData in addition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 190.89,
          "end": 193.083,
          "en": "so that you can see the difference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 194.25,
          "end": 196.38,
          "en": "But with that, we then call addExpense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 196.38,
          "end": 199.86,
          "en": "and pass our expenseData to this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 199.86,
          "end": 203.73,
          "en": "And we can then await this to wait for this expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 203.73,
          "end": 206.76,
          "en": "really to be created in the database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 206.76,
          "end": 209.46,
          "en": "before we then return a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 209.46,
          "end": 213.36,
          "en": "because that's something you should do in your actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 213.36,
          "end": 216.333,
          "en": "Your actions must return something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 217.324,
          "end": 220.05,
          "en": "And that something can be a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 220.05,
          "end": 221.25,
          "en": "that's quite common",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 221.25,
          "end": 223.41,
          "en": "but it could also be some raw data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 223.41,
          "end": 227.61,
          "en": "as you will see later again once we add validation again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 227.61,
          "end": 229.44,
          "en": "For the moment, I wanna return a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 229.44,
          "end": 230.67000000000002,
          "en": "and here it's quite common",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 230.67000000000002,
          "end": 232.71,
          "en": "that you return a redirect response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 232.71,
          "end": 235.65,
          "en": "because, for example, after creating a new expense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 235.65,
          "end": 239.91,
          "en": "I wanna redirect the user away from this form page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 239.91,
          "end": 243.03,
          "en": "where the expenseData was entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 243.03,
          "end": 245.52,
          "en": "And redirect the user to the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 245.52,
          "end": 247.653,
          "en": "with that list of expenses instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 248.82,
          "end": 251.76,
          "en": "So therefore here, we can use the redirect function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 251.76,
          "end": 253.47,
          "en": "which is provided by Remix,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 253.47,
          "end": 258.47,
          "en": "and which we import from @remix-run/node.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 258.48,
          "end": 260.49,
          "en": "And that is simply a utility function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 260.49,
          "end": 262.98,
          "en": "that creates a new redirect response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 262.98,
          "end": 265.29,
          "en": "and we simply pass a string to redirect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 265.29,
          "end": 268.95,
          "en": "which defines the path to which we wanna redirect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 268.95,
          "end": 272.733,
          "en": "In my case here, I wanna redirect the user to /expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 273.9,
          "end": 276.03,
          "en": "And that's now the finished action function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 276.03,
          "end": 278.25,
          "en": "for the moment, which should allow us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 278.25,
          "end": 281.103,
          "en": "to successfully create a new expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 282.36,
          "end": 284.88,
          "en": "With all these changes made,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 284.88,
          "end": 287.55,
          "en": "and arguably, these were a lot of changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 287.55,
          "end": 289.08,
          "en": "but with all these changes made,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 289.08,
          "end": 291.6,
          "en": "let's see whether everything works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 291.6,
          "end": 293.64,
          "en": "By restarting our development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 293.64,
          "end": 295.74,
          "en": "by running npm run dev,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 295.74,
          "end": 297.99,
          "en": "and then visiting our website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 297.99,
          "end": 300.21,
          "en": "For that, we can click the Get Started link here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 300.21,
          "end": 301.2,
          "en": "on the starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 301.2,
          "end": 303.27,
          "en": "which takes us to the expenses area",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 303.27,
          "end": 304.62,
          "en": "and then click Add Expense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 304.62,
          "end": 307.44,
          "en": "which opens this Add Expense modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 307.44,
          "end": 310.53,
          "en": "And then here let's try adding a new expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 310.53,
          "end": 312.513,
          "en": "I'll name is First Expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 313.44,
          "end": 316.65,
          "en": "And maybe give it an amount of 39.99.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 316.65,
          "end": 320.283,
          "en": "And choose any date in the past, and click Save Expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 321.42,
          "end": 322.71,
          "en": "And this look good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 322.71,
          "end": 323.88,
          "en": "We were redirected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 323.88,
          "end": 325.56,
          "en": "We did not get an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 325.56,
          "end": 326.91,
          "en": "We don't see the expense here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 326.91,
          "end": 328.05,
          "en": "That's a different expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 328.05,
          "end": 329.37,
          "en": "We don't see the expense yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 329.37,
          "end": 331.11,
          "en": "because we haven't added any code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 331.11,
          "end": 334.47,
          "en": "for really loading expense data from the database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 334.47,
          "end": 336.21,
          "en": "but since the app did not crash",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 336.21,
          "end": 337.74,
          "en": "and we were redirected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 337.74,
          "end": 339.69,
          "en": "it looks like it worked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 339.69,
          "end": 341.43,
          "en": "If we take a look here at our terminal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 341.43,
          "end": 343.71,
          "en": "we also see no error here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 343.71,
          "end": 344.88,
          "en": "Instead what we see here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 344.88,
          "end": 348.9,
          "en": "is that log data from the action here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 348.9,
          "end": 352.23,
          "en": "This log data where we log the expenseData object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 352.23,
          "end": 355.383,
          "en": "after converting formData to that expenseData object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 356.28,
          "end": 358.32,
          "en": "And we see that FormData before that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
